@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Health

# Liveness check used by the smoke test; no database or model calls.
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Chat page

# The chat page with the spec version picker (newest version selected).
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Ask

# Ask a question about the latest spec version (use the newest dated version from the picker).
# Returns the HTML fragment HTMX swaps into the page. Uses 3 model calls typically.
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

question=How does a client refresh an OAuth access token?&version=2026-07-28

###

# Search every spec version.
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

question=What changed in how servers declare tools?&version=all

###

# Validation: an unknown version returns a 422 error fragment without calling any model.
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

question=What is sampling?&version=1999-01-01
